WEBVTT

00:00:00.855 --> 00:00:03.325
"Road Closed"

00:00:10.165 --> 00:00:11.825
Here they come.

00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:23.505
Young Miss, be sure not to bite your tongue.

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:27.715
Nasty!

00:00:36.525 --> 00:00:38.425
It's no use! We can't catch them!

00:00:38.425 --> 00:00:41.295
Secure them now, no matter what it takes!

00:01:17.295 --> 00:01:19.565
Now, bring them down.

00:01:53.805 --> 00:01:56.595
Who on earth is that?

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:06.345
We still have not located Sigelinde Baumgard.

00:02:06.345 --> 00:02:07.985
We will continue our search.

00:02:07.985 --> 00:02:10.215
- There is no need.
- Sir?

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:13.985
I said there is no need. We're withdrawing.

00:02:13.985 --> 00:02:15.545
Yes, sir.

00:02:17.825 --> 00:02:21.395
The mission is over. Return to headquarters,

00:02:21.395 --> 00:02:23.385
and wait there for further orders.

00:02:42.085 --> 00:02:47.825
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:02:47.825 --> 00:02:53.695
sono itami no imi sae

00:02:53.695 --> 00:02:59.435
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:02:59.435 --> 00:03:02.665
Boku wa kitto...

00:03:04.035 --> 00:03:10.345
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:03:10.345 --> 00:03:17.885
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:03:17.885 --> 00:03:20.755
I'll always be with you

00:03:20.755 --> 00:03:23.395
see the sky in front of you

00:03:23.395 --> 00:03:27.755
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:03:29.465 --> 00:03:34.935
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:03:34.935 --> 00:03:37.605
utau yo

00:03:37.605 --> 00:03:46.275
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:03:59.825 --> 00:04:02.625
Okay, thank you for waiting.

00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:06.635
Here is the daily lunch special
and the tilefish saikyo miso combo.

00:04:06.635 --> 00:04:06.905
"Toa"
Here is the daily lunch special
and the tilefish saikyo miso combo.

00:04:06.905 --> 00:04:07.805
"Toa"
And here is the mentaiko pasta.
Please, enjoy your meal.

00:04:07.805 --> 00:04:11.965
And here is the mentaiko pasta.
Please, enjoy your meal.

00:04:17.145 --> 00:04:18.645
Whoo, I'm bushed.

00:04:18.645 --> 00:04:20.985
Good work, Toa. Are you done for the day?

00:04:20.985 --> 00:04:22.585
Mm-hmm, I had the early shift.

00:04:22.585 --> 00:04:27.025
Is your man picking you up
again today? How lovey-dovey!

00:04:27.025 --> 00:04:30.295
I-I wouldn't say that...

00:04:30.295 --> 00:04:33.255
If you're that embarrassed
about it, it's lovey-dovey!

00:04:33.255 --> 00:04:36.425
Well, Toa, give your
adoring darling our regards!

00:04:39.035 --> 00:04:41.365
Lovey-dovey...

00:04:41.365 --> 00:04:44.855
Maybe. I wonder if that's how it looks.

00:04:53.685 --> 00:04:56.675
- Jin!
- Toa, you're right on time.

00:05:02.555 --> 00:05:04.315
Hold on tight.

00:05:08.165 --> 00:05:12.495
I'll just bet he calls Toa his "little bride."

00:05:12.495 --> 00:05:16.505
He doesn't look like the sort to me.

00:05:16.505 --> 00:05:18.975
- Come on, back to work.
- Right.

00:05:38.755 --> 00:05:40.725
How many of them are there?!

00:05:59.275 --> 00:06:01.945
Hmph, he got away.

00:06:04.085 --> 00:06:08.425
The repairs appear to be proceeding smoothly.

00:06:08.425 --> 00:06:10.425
Between rebuilding the
installation and compensation

00:06:10.425 --> 00:06:13.025
for those residents who were displaced,

00:06:13.025 --> 00:06:19.065
I'll have to review the Girouard's
finances for the next ten years.

00:06:19.065 --> 00:06:22.305
You were able to remove Prince Asim.

00:06:22.305 --> 00:06:27.645
In the long run, it's a small
price to pay, isn't it?

00:06:27.645 --> 00:06:30.945
Were it possible, I'd like to turn back time,

00:06:30.945 --> 00:06:35.085
and see to it that Asim was
never around in the first place.

00:06:35.085 --> 00:06:36.955
That's pretty heartless.

00:06:36.955 --> 00:06:40.925
There are any number of people
to take the prince's place.

00:06:40.925 --> 00:06:44.825
It's not the sentiment between
father and son that's important,

00:06:44.825 --> 00:06:50.565
it's how they will succeed me,
and secure their claim to power.

00:06:50.565 --> 00:06:52.835
You must be forward-looking
in conducting all things,

00:06:52.835 --> 00:06:55.305
or your business will not succeed.

00:06:55.305 --> 00:06:59.005
That goes the same for you, too, right?

00:06:59.005 --> 00:07:04.115
We are not pursuing the Dragons to make profit.

00:07:04.115 --> 00:07:07.785
Oh, is that right?

00:07:07.785 --> 00:07:11.085
You are hunting down those
who were once under you.

00:07:11.085 --> 00:07:16.955
If you ask me, you are the one
who is acting far more heartless.

00:07:16.955 --> 00:07:22.365
Let go of me, this is just a scratch.
Let me rest a bit, and I'll heal.

00:07:22.365 --> 00:07:24.495
We can't afford to.

00:07:24.495 --> 00:07:26.865
We don't have time to rest.

00:07:26.865 --> 00:07:30.825
Man, you're one rough Dragon tamer.

00:07:42.385 --> 00:07:44.655
Former Captain Raina,

00:07:44.655 --> 00:07:50.155
I don't pull punches very well.
I'll probably kill you next time.

00:07:50.155 --> 00:07:54.025
So please, stop running away.

00:07:54.025 --> 00:07:56.165
Kazuki...

00:07:56.165 --> 00:07:58.195
You're going to regret holding back against me!

00:07:58.195 --> 00:08:00.295
Easy, Howling Star.

00:08:06.575 --> 00:08:11.015
Under the circumstances, we cannot win.

00:08:11.015 --> 00:08:13.215
That's my former captain for you.

00:08:13.215 --> 00:08:16.685
Your clever judgment is as sharp as ever.

00:08:16.685 --> 00:08:20.085
I invite you two to see Tartarus.

00:08:24.495 --> 00:08:27.695
Having witnessed the tragedy
on Mars with their own eyes,

00:08:27.695 --> 00:08:30.865
the world trembled at the power of the Dragons.

00:08:30.865 --> 00:08:34.105
The Dragons themselves are a danger.

00:08:34.105 --> 00:08:37.875
That's why we started the new D Project.

00:08:37.875 --> 00:08:40.875
Fighting poison with poison, huh?

00:08:40.875 --> 00:08:44.715
Both Thanatos and Dragons
are nothing but deadly venom

00:08:44.715 --> 00:08:46.545
to the rest of humanity.

00:08:46.545 --> 00:08:51.385
But sometimes, venom can
also act as a wonder drug.

00:08:51.385 --> 00:08:54.725
I would like for ISDA and
the Girouard to continue on

00:08:54.725 --> 00:08:58.755
as good business partners from here on, as well.

00:08:58.755 --> 00:09:01.025
To promote further wealth.

00:09:28.385 --> 00:09:32.225
We've received the scheduled
observation data from Deep Eye.

00:09:32.225 --> 00:09:35.065
Acknowledged, beginning analysis.

00:09:35.065 --> 00:09:38.095
No changes in Thanatos' orbital parameters.

00:09:38.095 --> 00:09:43.305
It has left Pluto's orbit, and is
currently proceeding toward Saturn.

00:09:43.305 --> 00:09:49.345
"Thanatos's in its Heaven,
all's right with the world."

00:09:49.345 --> 00:09:52.515
Megumi, check the datalink with headquarters.

00:09:52.515 --> 00:09:54.615
Everything's okay.

00:09:54.615 --> 00:09:56.285
Ryoko, how about you?

00:09:56.285 --> 00:10:01.155
Who cares? After all, the captain
won't come out of his room.

00:10:01.155 --> 00:10:02.925
If we ask him for orders on every little thing,

00:10:02.925 --> 00:10:04.825
nothing would ever get done.

00:10:04.825 --> 00:10:09.295
On paper, he's been promoted,
but in reality, it's a demotion.

00:10:09.295 --> 00:10:11.995
I can understand why he'd hit the bottle.

00:10:11.995 --> 00:10:15.205
I wish he'd put himself in the shoes of
those who are caught in the middle of it,

00:10:15.205 --> 00:10:17.805
and forced to live out here in space.

00:10:17.805 --> 00:10:25.045
Then again, it's easier on my bust,
so I like living in space!

00:10:25.045 --> 00:10:29.275
Yeah, yeah. Let's hear it for zero gravity.

00:11:02.485 --> 00:11:05.475
All right. Perfect!

00:11:14.165 --> 00:11:21.065
This Tartarus place is a pretty
swanky installation, for ISDA, huh?

00:11:21.065 --> 00:11:24.575
It's formal designation is
Disposal and Trial Island No. 2.

00:11:24.575 --> 00:11:26.335
It's a Dragon graveyard.

00:11:26.335 --> 00:11:29.365
You've mistaken it for a three-star
garbage dumping ground, right?

00:11:31.275 --> 00:11:32.715
Amadeus...

00:11:32.715 --> 00:11:34.715
They caught you, too, did they?

00:11:34.715 --> 00:11:38.715
I am most pleased to see that
you are all right, Raina-sama.

00:11:38.715 --> 00:11:41.025
And you, Howling Star-sama.

00:11:41.025 --> 00:11:43.255
Don't say it like I'm an afterthought.

00:11:43.255 --> 00:11:46.555
What about Sigelinde? She's not with you?

00:11:46.555 --> 00:11:52.295
I believe she is safe. I acted as
a decoy, to allow her to escape.

00:11:52.295 --> 00:11:56.065
- I see.
- Well, as long as she's alive, I guess...

00:11:58.535 --> 00:12:01.105
Fine conditions, these.

00:12:01.105 --> 00:12:03.605
Welcome home, sir!

00:12:03.605 --> 00:12:06.945
We're running a promotion right now!

00:12:06.945 --> 00:12:10.145
We'll offer you 20% extra dere today!

00:12:19.295 --> 00:12:21.095
I'm back.

00:12:21.095 --> 00:12:26.835
I hacked into the ISDA network.
No change in Thanatos' movement.

00:12:26.835 --> 00:12:29.465
It's headed for Earth, all right.

00:12:29.465 --> 00:12:32.075
Yeah, so it would seem.

00:12:32.075 --> 00:12:37.675
Professor, do you still believe
that Dragons and mankind

00:12:37.675 --> 00:12:40.845
will be able to coexist?

00:12:40.845 --> 00:12:43.645
I sure hope they'll want to.

00:12:43.645 --> 00:12:48.625
That's why I rescued them from ISDA.

00:12:48.625 --> 00:12:50.825
It's not as if I don't
understand Sakaki's feelings

00:12:50.825 --> 00:12:53.095
in trying to dispose of them.

00:12:53.095 --> 00:12:56.495
In light of the tragedy on Mars,
it's disquieting to me

00:12:56.495 --> 00:13:02.135
to think of what latent powers
I may have inside of me.

00:13:02.135 --> 00:13:05.335
Not at all! Professor, you're still you.

00:13:07.275 --> 00:13:12.545
Exactly what is it that Thanatos
is planning to do to us?

00:13:12.545 --> 00:13:17.785
I don't know. Thanatos' thoughts
don't come through at all anymore.

00:13:17.785 --> 00:13:22.155
Our time remaining is already quite short.

00:13:24.895 --> 00:13:27.825
That should just about finish our shopping.

00:13:27.825 --> 00:13:30.025
Do you want to go anywhere else?

00:13:30.025 --> 00:13:32.365
I heard about a place from the girls at work.

00:13:32.365 --> 00:13:35.235
There's a bakery that opened last week up ahead,

00:13:35.235 --> 00:13:39.635
and they say the croissants
there are very delicious.

00:13:39.635 --> 00:13:42.205
- Wanna have a look?
- All right, then.

00:13:42.205 --> 00:13:46.875
Ah, Mom, look! The first star!

00:13:46.875 --> 00:13:49.415
No, it isn't. That's Mars.

00:13:49.415 --> 00:13:51.515
- Mars?
- Yes.

00:13:51.515 --> 00:13:56.225
A year ago, there was a bad Dragon
who ran wild and wrecked the planet.

00:13:56.225 --> 00:14:01.825
That's why Mars burns bright red,
and you can now see it during the daytime.

00:14:01.825 --> 00:14:03.595
Are Dragons bad?

00:14:03.595 --> 00:14:06.655
Yes, they're very bad, and scary.

00:14:09.835 --> 00:14:11.395
Toa...

00:14:13.575 --> 00:14:17.675
Thanatos continues to
follow its course to Earth.

00:14:17.675 --> 00:14:20.215
According to ISDA,
who is continuing to observe it,

00:14:20.215 --> 00:14:22.915
it will likely be seven years
before Thanatos reaches

00:14:22.915 --> 00:14:28.255
its closest point to Earth. And now, more news.

00:14:37.635 --> 00:14:41.135
Gio, we're home!

00:14:41.135 --> 00:14:46.605
I've gotten supper ready. Tonight,
we're having Japanese and Chinese.

00:14:46.605 --> 00:14:49.545
If you could have waited a little bit,
I would have helped you.

00:14:49.545 --> 00:14:51.775
- No thanks.
- Why not?

00:14:51.775 --> 00:14:54.105
You'd ruin the dish.

00:14:55.545 --> 00:14:57.245
How am I supposed to let someone

00:14:57.245 --> 00:15:00.885
who mistook brewing dried seaweed flakes
for tea leaves for after-dinner tea

00:15:00.885 --> 00:15:02.755
take care of seasoning things?

00:15:04.095 --> 00:15:06.795
Oh, and here I thought
we were drinking kelp tea.

00:15:06.795 --> 00:15:08.925
Thanks, Jin.

00:15:08.925 --> 00:15:11.555
But someday, I'm gonna...

00:15:15.105 --> 00:15:16.835
Sigelinde?!

00:15:16.835 --> 00:15:20.505
Who was it that cooked this dish?

00:15:20.505 --> 00:15:23.775
- Lt was me.
- You rely too much on seasonings.

00:15:23.775 --> 00:15:25.845
They drown out the flavor of the ingredients.

00:15:25.845 --> 00:15:27.615
R-Really?

00:15:27.615 --> 00:15:29.475
What are you doing here?

00:15:31.185 --> 00:15:33.355
You're awful!

00:15:33.355 --> 00:15:35.685
You, a Dragon, wearing glasses!

00:15:35.685 --> 00:15:37.185
Is that supposed to be a disguise?

00:15:37.185 --> 00:15:38.985
Don't make me laugh!

00:15:41.265 --> 00:15:43.125
Excuse me.

00:15:43.125 --> 00:15:45.295
It's all the dust in here.

00:15:45.295 --> 00:15:47.705
Bless you.

00:15:47.705 --> 00:15:50.105
After covering up your whereabouts on Mars,

00:15:50.105 --> 00:15:53.005
I wondered where you were
and what you were up to,

00:15:53.005 --> 00:15:57.545
but I never imagined you'd be here,
playing house like this.

00:15:57.545 --> 00:16:00.045
You disappoint me.

00:16:00.045 --> 00:16:03.815
Sigelinde, we've been...

00:16:03.815 --> 00:16:06.115
Have you finished your touching reunion?

00:16:06.115 --> 00:16:08.325
Y-You!

00:16:08.325 --> 00:16:10.725
Yo, long time no see.

00:16:26.705 --> 00:16:30.405
Kazuki...

00:16:30.405 --> 00:16:34.585
I will grant your wish.

00:16:34.585 --> 00:16:38.145
I will kill Jin for you.

00:16:46.525 --> 00:16:50.995
Well, what can I say? You three
are looking well, aren't you?

00:16:50.995 --> 00:16:55.205
Yonamine-san, have you been
keeping watch on us all this time?

00:16:55.205 --> 00:16:56.835
That's the size of it.

00:16:56.835 --> 00:16:58.935
You have no shame.

00:16:58.935 --> 00:17:01.345
Two young men and a lady,
up here in the mountains,

00:17:01.345 --> 00:17:04.675
far away from civilization, for a whole year.

00:17:04.675 --> 00:17:06.715
Just what sort of lives are you living?

00:17:06.715 --> 00:17:08.515
The usual kind.

00:17:08.515 --> 00:17:14.725
The three of us hold down jobs,
make our meals, and live normally.

00:17:14.725 --> 00:17:17.625
This time has been like a dream.

00:17:17.625 --> 00:17:19.295
Dream?!

00:17:19.295 --> 00:17:21.395
Dream, you say?!

00:17:21.395 --> 00:17:23.865
Get real, Kamishina Jin!

00:17:23.865 --> 00:17:25.865
You throw everything around you into chaos,

00:17:25.865 --> 00:17:27.605
drag a bunch of people into it with you,

00:17:27.605 --> 00:17:30.205
and at the end of it all,
you retire out to the country,

00:17:30.205 --> 00:17:31.735
and live like a hermit!

00:17:31.735 --> 00:17:35.905
That's what you call a dream?!
You've got to be kidding me!

00:17:35.905 --> 00:17:39.405
This dream cost us Akira and Machina!

00:17:44.385 --> 00:17:48.885
Agathion number 01 through
number 07 show no irregularities.

00:17:48.885 --> 00:17:52.585
Moving on to reconstruction
of their remote control units.

00:18:04.775 --> 00:18:08.295
What... have I done?

00:18:16.145 --> 00:18:18.485
Dad...

00:18:18.485 --> 00:18:23.455
ISDA is trying to dispose of the Dragons!

00:18:23.455 --> 00:18:28.295
We rebelled, and ran away with our Dragons.

00:18:28.295 --> 00:18:31.365
Raina and Howling Star have been caught.

00:18:31.365 --> 00:18:35.035
Amadeus, too, to let me escape.

00:18:35.035 --> 00:18:38.675
Commander Sakaki is planning
to exterminate the Dragons.

00:18:38.675 --> 00:18:40.375
If they do that,

00:18:40.375 --> 00:18:43.875
Thanatos might become angry
and destroy this world.

00:18:43.875 --> 00:18:49.115
We can kill Thanatos.
That must be what Sakaki is thinking.

00:18:49.115 --> 00:18:52.315
But there's nothing too exciting about his plan.

00:18:52.315 --> 00:18:56.455
Thanatos isn't interested in Earth or humanity.

00:18:56.455 --> 00:18:58.195
Once the Dragons are taken back to it,

00:18:58.195 --> 00:19:00.725
it will leave the solar system quietly.

00:19:00.725 --> 00:19:05.395
You're saying that Earth is nothing
more than a spawning ground?

00:19:05.395 --> 00:19:09.735
But then, that's not going to
convince the rest of the world.

00:19:21.085 --> 00:19:22.845
Say in there...

00:19:22.845 --> 00:19:27.155
You've become quite human-like
over this last year, haven't you?

00:19:27.155 --> 00:19:31.425
If this were a melodrama,
you'd play the role of the clown.

00:19:31.425 --> 00:19:35.995
I think so too, sometimes.

00:19:35.995 --> 00:19:37.995
And?

00:19:37.995 --> 00:19:41.105
What do you want to do?

00:19:41.105 --> 00:19:43.605
You can't very well go on clinging to those two,

00:19:43.605 --> 00:19:46.405
like a turd hanging off a goldfish, right?

00:19:50.545 --> 00:19:56.745
So? What's so good about Jin
that you're here with him?

00:19:56.745 --> 00:19:59.015
I just love him. That's all.

00:19:59.015 --> 00:20:01.055
But that's just a feeling that was created

00:20:01.055 --> 00:20:03.585
by going through Resonance with Jin, isn't it?

00:20:03.585 --> 00:20:06.095
It's not of your own free will, is it?

00:20:06.095 --> 00:20:09.295
Created feeling?

00:20:09.295 --> 00:20:11.895
Jin, get a bath towel ready!

00:20:11.895 --> 00:20:16.605
A fluffy one, of course,
freshly washed with fabric softener.

00:20:16.605 --> 00:20:18.875
Why me?

00:20:18.875 --> 00:20:21.645
You've been awfully hard on me.

00:20:21.645 --> 00:20:26.045
Little man! Amadeus would have
it ready for me without a word.

00:20:26.045 --> 00:20:27.915
Don't be so unreasonable.

00:20:32.115 --> 00:20:35.655
I-I-I'll just leave it here!

00:20:35.655 --> 00:20:37.315
Hey, Jin!

00:20:55.505 --> 00:20:57.745
Jin, the water's getting cold!

00:20:57.745 --> 00:21:01.415
Don't be so stingy with the heat out there!

00:21:01.415 --> 00:21:05.675
Geez... Just how spoiled was your upbringing?

00:21:06.955 --> 00:21:09.625
Toa...

00:21:09.625 --> 00:21:12.355
Jin, I...

00:21:14.925 --> 00:21:17.125
You don't have to say anything.

00:21:19.695 --> 00:21:22.135
Jin...

00:21:22.135 --> 00:21:25.365
I've enjoyed... this year.

00:21:31.815 --> 00:21:36.115
I'll have faith in what I'm feeling now.

00:21:50.795 --> 00:21:53.665
Clown, huh?

00:21:58.705 --> 00:22:00.505
Thanatos...

00:22:19.395 --> 00:22:21.665
Hakisuteta kotoba no imi sae

00:22:21.665 --> 00:22:23.925
fukaku kangaetari wa shinai

00:22:23.925 --> 00:22:28.265
ima wo tada nigekiru dake

00:22:28.265 --> 00:22:30.535
Mata nannimo nakatta you ni

00:22:30.535 --> 00:22:32.675
onaji koto wo kurikaeshite'ru

00:22:32.675 --> 00:22:36.345
Muimi nano yo mata sonna nige

00:22:36.345 --> 00:22:45.215
Kekkyoku youchi de kodomo no manma da ne

00:22:45.215 --> 00:22:54.625
Hitori yogari kako no jibun wa mou sute na

00:22:54.625 --> 00:22:59.135
Tadashii tatakai wa
sou kimi no naka de hajimaru

00:22:59.135 --> 00:23:03.565
Kimi nara dou suru? Mou girigiri ja nai?

00:23:03.565 --> 00:23:08.645
Houkai shite shimau mae ni arubeki sugata wo

00:23:08.645 --> 00:23:15.745
omoiokoshite mite mi na yo

00:23:15.745 --> 00:23:21.875
Fight or flight

00:23:24.555 --> 00:23:29.325
Fight or flight

00:23:43.005 --> 00:23:47.075
We've worked this whole year through.
I wish we got bonuses.

00:23:47.075 --> 00:23:50.015
It still feels like it's only
been one week, huh?

00:23:50.015 --> 00:23:52.185
My wage went up 100 yen per hour!

00:23:52.185 --> 00:23:53.655
You're working here part-time?!

00:23:53.655 --> 00:23:56.355
Huh? Aren't you getting it in space food?

00:23:56.355 --> 00:23:57.855
In-kind wages?!

00:23:57.855 --> 00:24:01.995
Oh, right, they said if we do
the preview, we'd get a bonus.

00:24:01.995 --> 00:24:05.435
- On the next Dragonaut,
father-daughter discord?!
- Next time, we're going over to his house!
- Preview! Pursuit! Hiding! Excitement!

00:24:05.435 --> 00:24:07.295
Hey, stop scrambling for it!
